# Cloudflare Pages response headers (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §3k). The panel is never framed, indexed or cached by others.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive
  Permissions-Policy: microphone=(), camera=(), geolocation=(self), payment=(), usb=(), serial=(), bluetooth=()
